://forums.oculus.com/developer/discussion/36785/gearvr-standby-mode-not-pausing-application\n2) \"The loading screens last longer than 4 seconds and don't have any loading animation.\" The loading sequence duration depends on the song, which is being imported. A longer song equals a longer loading screen. We've removed elements like the particles from the loading scene and added an additional explanation to avoid confusion about the app having potentially freezed.", "created_date": 1471265352, "id": "1383290505019235", "version": "1.2", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}